Package: scrubbed
Version: @VERSION@
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libcurl4t64 (>= 7.16.2) | libcurl4 (>= 7.16.2), libc6 (>= 2.36), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2)
Recommends: zlib1g
Maintainer: Shammah Chancellor <213740+schancel@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/schancel/scrubbed
Description: text sanitization CLI: mojibake repair, HTML-to-Markdown extraction
 scrubbed repairs mojibake and normalizes text encodings, extracts clean
 Markdown from HTML, and runs a range-based, parallel filter pipeline over
 multiple documents from the command line. Bash, zsh, and fish completions
 are installed automatically.
